  "query_preview": "../Monday through Wednesday/...As the low slowly \ndissipates near south-central AK, it will meander and track \nmultiple fronts across the panhandle. This setup, reinforced by a \nconsistent slew of upper level troughs and divergent flow aloft, \nkeeps precipitation in the forecast for the extended period, \nalthough overall impacts are expected to diminish gradually \nthrough the week. One thing of note is as the low dissipates, the\npressure gradient over the northern panhandle becomes more north \nto south oriented, causing a potential increase in winds within \nLynn Canal through Monday and Tuesday.",
